# 74
#title Put finished plans behind one Done control in the Plans strip
#url https://github.com/MobileReality/lantern/pull/74
#branch feat/plans-done-modal
#base main
#opened 2026-11-19
#head cd682f119ffd83f911895a5c714e9a007f98389d
#describe what The Plans strip lists only unfinished plans; finished ones sit behind a Done N control that opens a list.
#describe before Every plan was a chip in the strip, and a long list of done plans overflowed it.
#describe after Unfinished plans are chips; Done N opens a popover of finished plans, and picking one opens it in the Planning view.
#describe verified typecheck, lint and the full test suite pass; the new test file fails 6 of 6 on the old strip.
+ test/lantern-plan-strip-done.test.ts
~ skills/lantern-plan/scripts/messages.json
~ src/renderer/lantern-plans.css
~ src/renderer/lib/lanternplanstrip.ts
#order src/renderer/lib/lanternplanstrip.ts
#order skills/lantern-plan/scripts/messages.json
#order src/renderer/lantern-plans.css
#order test/lantern-plan-strip-done.test.ts
#reason test/lantern-plan-strip-done.test.ts Proves finished plans leave the strip, the control counts them, the list opens and closes, and a pick opens the plan.
#reason skills/lantern-plan/scripts/messages.json Adds the Done control's label, tooltip and list heading as view messages, as the catalogue rule requires.
#reason src/renderer/lantern-plans.css Styles the Done control and its popover list so they match the strip's chips.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lanternplanstrip.ts Keeps the strip short by moving finished plans behind one Done control that opens them in a popover.
#story Finding an unfinished plan in a long list
#step actor A person with many plans
#step action opens the Plans strip
#file src/renderer/lib/lanternplanstrip.ts
#step subject the list of plans
#below interaction Sees only plans still in progress, plus a Done count
#below consequence Every plan, done or not, filled and overflowed the strip => Finished plans wait behind one Done control
#story Opening a finished plan
#step actor A person
#step action presses Done and picks a plan
#file test/lantern-plan-strip-done.test.ts
#step subject the finished plan
#below interaction Reads it in the Planning view, as with any chip
#below consequence A finished plan was a chip among the rest => It is reached from a list that Escape or a click away closes
